CtrlLingo · 译点
Independent Windows distribution maintained by boluomi2001.
Project: https://github.com/boluomi2001/ctrllingo

Based on Qingjian by the Qingjian authors and contributors:
https://github.com/qingjian-team/qingjian
Upstream base: c97ff2b61933d6fcd845ee4f4f470faf3ea83bf6

This is a modified distribution, not an official Qingjian release.
Changes include Ctrl-triggered multilingual sentence translation, usage and cost
presentation, conservative sentence rescoring, alternate-sentence learning, and
the independent CtrlLingo Windows identity, branding and distribution materials.
The inherited input engine and other upstream work remain attributed to their
original authors. Original copyright and license notices are retained.

